## Installation

### OCI Artifact (Preferred)

```bash
helm install {{ template "chart.name" . }} oci://ghcr.io/neeron/charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }}
```

### HTTP Repository

```bash
helm repo add neeron https://charts.neeron.me
helm repo update
helm install {{ template "chart.name" . }} neeron/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }}
```

